        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-24T12:03:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><b>Dahan Event: Forsake the Barren Land: On Each Board: Push 2 Dahan from a land with Blight to a land without Blight.</b></p>\n<p><b>&gt;&gt; a board don`t have&nbsp;&nbsp;'2 Dahan from a land with Blight'&nbsp;but have&nbsp;'1&nbsp;Dahan from a land with Blight'. can i triger '1&nbsp;Dahan from a land with Blight'?</b></p>\n<p><b>Tsunami :&nbsp;2 Fear. 8 Damage. Destroy 2 Dahan.</b></p>\n<p><b>&gt;&gt;target land have 1 dahan. 1 dahan is destroy?</b></p>\n<p><b>Avoid the Dahan lv 1:&nbsp;&nbsp;Invaders do not Explore into lands with at least 2 Dahan.</b></p>\n<p><b>&gt;&gt; if all land have only 1 dahan, event is nothing happen?</b></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:11.936Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
